    {
      "id": "c-shiji-127-rizhe:p019",
      "text": "太史公曰：古者卜人所以不載者，多不見于篇。及至司馬季主，余志而著之。",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "mentions": [
